<title>ITALY: Italian Sept car registrations fell 8.55 pct.</title>
<headline>Italian Sept car registrations fell 8.55 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian new car registrations fell 8.55 percent to 116,000 units in September, compared with 126,843 units in September 1995, the Italian Ministry of Transport said in a statement.</p>
</text>
